    "Each file is backed up first, next to itself (….%@). These lines are removed:": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jede Datei wird zuerst neben sich selbst gesichert (….%@). Diese Zeilen werden entfernt:"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque fichier est d’abord sauvegardé à côté de lui-même (….%@). Ces lignes sont supprimées :"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada archivo se respalda antes, junto a sí mismo (….%@). Se quitan estas líneas:"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "各ファイルは、その隣に先にバックアップされます(….%@)。次の行が削除されます:"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个文件都会先在其旁边备份（….%@）。将移除以下行："
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada arquivo tem backup antes, ao lado dele (….%@). Estas linhas são removidas:"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ogni file viene prima salvato in copia, accanto a sé stesso (….%@). Queste righe vengono rimosse:"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "각 파일은 먼저 같은 위치에 백업됩니다(….%@). 다음 줄이 제거됩니다:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each runs as its own brew upgrade, one at a time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jedes läuft als eigenes brew upgrade, nacheinander."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chacun s’exécute comme son propre brew upgrade, un à la fois."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada uno se ejecuta como su propio brew upgrade, uno a la vez."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "それぞれ個別の brew upgrade として、1つずつ実行されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个都作为独立的 brew upgrade 依次运行。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada um é executado como seu próprio brew upgrade, um por vez."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ognuno viene eseguito come brew upgrade a sé, uno alla volta."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "각각 별도의 brew upgrade로 하나씩 실행됩니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edits in Homebrew's checkout can stop brew update. Resetting it discards them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Änderungen im Checkout von Homebrew können brew update stoppen. Zurücksetzen verwirft sie."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Des modifications dans le dépôt de Homebrew peuvent bloquer brew update. Le réinitialiser les supprime."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las ediciones en el checkout de Homebrew pueden detener brew update. Restablecerlo las descarta."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Homebrewのチェックアウト内の編集は、brew update を妨げることがあります。リセットすると破棄されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Homebrew 检出目录中的改动可能导致 brew update 停止。重置会丢弃这些改动。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Edições no checkout do Homebrew podem impedir o brew update. Redefini-lo as descarta."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le modifiche nel checkout di Homebrew possono bloccare brew update. Ripristinarlo le scarta."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Homebrew 체크아웃을 편집하면 brew update가 중단될 수 있습니다. 재설정하면 편집 내용이 삭제됩니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
