    "From the Homebrew/install README (\"Uninstall Homebrew\"), with its --path option so it removes only the Homebrew Tankard is showing. It runs in Terminal and asks once more before removing anything.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aus der README von Homebrew/install („Uninstall Homebrew“), mit der Option --path, damit nur das Homebrew entfernt wird, das Tankard anzeigt. Es läuft im Terminal und fragt vor dem Entfernen noch einmal nach."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tiré du README de Homebrew/install (« Uninstall Homebrew »), avec son option --path pour ne supprimer que le Homebrew affiché par Tankard. Il s’exécute dans Terminal et demande une dernière confirmation avant de supprimer quoi que ce soit."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Del README de Homebrew/install (\"Uninstall Homebrew\"), con su opción --path para que solo elimine el Homebrew que Tankard está mostrando. Se ejecuta en Terminal y pregunta una vez más antes de eliminar nada."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Homebrew/install のREADME(「Uninstall Homebrew」)に基づき、--path オプションを付けて、Tankardが表示しているHomebrewだけを削除します。ターミナルで実行され、削除前にもう一度確認します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "来自 Homebrew/install README（“Uninstall Homebrew”），带 --path 选项，因此只会移除 Tankard 显示的那个 Homebrew。它在“终端”中运行，并在移除任何内容前再次询问。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Do README do Homebrew/install (\"Uninstall Homebrew\"), com a opção --path para remover apenas o Homebrew exibido pelo Tankard. Executa no Terminal e pergunta mais uma vez antes de remover qualquer coisa."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dal README di Homebrew/install (\"Uninstall Homebrew\"), con l'opzione --path così rimuove solo l'Homebrew mostrato da Tankard. Viene eseguito in Terminale e chiede ancora conferma prima di rimuovere qualcosa."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Homebrew/install README(\"Uninstall Homebrew\")의 방법이며, --path 옵션으로 Tankard가 표시 중인 Homebrew만 제거합니다. 터미널에서 실행되며 제거 전에 한 번 더 확인합니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
