    "Pinned packages are skipped, and so are packages whose dependencies are pinned.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fixierte Pakete werden übersprungen, ebenso Pakete, deren Abhängigkeiten fixiert sind."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les paquets épinglés sont ignorés, ainsi que ceux dont les dépendances sont épinglées."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los paquetes fijados se omiten, y también los paquetes cuyas dependencias están fijadas."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ピン留めされたパッケージはスキップされ、依存関係がピン留めされているパッケージもスキップされます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已固定的软件包会被跳过，依赖项已固定的软件包也会被跳过。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pacotes fixados são ignorados, assim como pacotes cujas dependências estão fixadas."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I pacchetti bloccati vengono saltati, così come i pacchetti le cui dipendenze sono bloccate."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "고정된 패키지와, 의존하는 패키지가 고정된 패키지는 건너뜁니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pinned packages aren't upgraded: brew upgrade skips them. Unpin one to include it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fixierte Pakete werden nicht aktualisiert: brew upgrade überspringt sie. Löse die Fixierung, um eines einzubeziehen."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les paquets épinglés ne sont pas mis à niveau : brew upgrade les ignore. Désépinglez-en un pour l’inclure."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los paquetes fijados no se actualizan: brew upgrade los omite. Desfija uno para incluirlo."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ピン留めされたパッケージはアップグレードされません。brew upgradeがスキップします。含めるにはピン留めを解除してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已固定的软件包不会升级：brew upgrade 会跳过它们。取消固定后才会包含。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pacotes fixados não são atualizados: o brew upgrade os ignora. Desafixe um para incluí-lo."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I pacchetti bloccati non vengono aggiornati: brew upgrade li salta. Sbloccane uno per includerlo."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "고정된 패키지는 업그레이드되지 않습니다. brew upgrade가 건너뜁니다. 포함하려면 고정을 해제하세요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pinned: brew upgrade skips it, and Upgrade all leaves it out": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fixiert: brew upgrade überspringt es, und „Alle upgraden“ lässt es aus"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
