    "Takes this Mac off Intelbrew: brew goes back to Homebrew's own repository and its API. Your installed packages stay as they are.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nimmt diesen Mac von Intelbrew: brew nutzt wieder das eigene Repository und die API von Homebrew. Deine installierten Pakete bleiben unverändert."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Retire ce Mac d’Intelbrew : brew revient au dépôt et à l’API de Homebrew. Vos paquets installés restent tels quels."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saca este Mac de Intelbrew: brew vuelve al repositorio propio de Homebrew y a su API. Tus paquetes instalados se quedan como están."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このMacでIntelbrewを使わないようにします。brewはHomebrew本来のリポジトリとAPIに戻ります。インストール済みのパッケージはそのままです。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "让这台 Mac 脱离 Intelbrew：brew 将回到 Homebrew 自己的仓库和 API。你已安装的软件包保持不变。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tira este Mac do Intelbrew: o brew volta ao repositório e à API do próprio Homebrew. Seus pacotes instalados permanecem como estão."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toglie questo Mac da Intelbrew: brew torna al repository e all'API di Homebrew. I pacchetti installati restano come sono."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이 Mac에서 Intelbrew를 해제합니다. brew가 Homebrew 자체 저장소와 API로 돌아갑니다. 설치된 패키지는 그대로 유지됩니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
