    "brew tap-info --installed --json. Official taps in API mode are read from Homebrew's API and aren't tapped. Trust is brew 7's (brew trust --tap): \"Trust non-official tap formulae, casks or commands so Homebrew may load them.\" Tankard never runs brew untap --force.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "brew tap-info --installed --json. Offizielle Taps im API-Modus werden aus der Homebrew-API gelesen und nicht getappt. Vertrauen ist das von brew 7 (brew trust --tap): „Trust non-official tap formulae, casks or commands so Homebrew may load them.“ Tankard führt nie brew untap --force aus."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "brew tap-info --installed --json. Les taps officiels en mode API sont lus depuis l’API de Homebrew et ne sont pas tappés. L’approbation est celle de brew 7 (brew trust --tap) : \"Trust non-official tap formulae, casks or commands so Homebrew may load them.\" Tankard n’exécute jamais brew untap --force."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "brew tap-info --installed --json. Los taps oficiales en modo API se leen desde la API de Homebrew y no están en un tap. La confianza es la de brew 7 (brew trust --tap): \"Trust non-official tap formulae, casks or commands so Homebrew may load them.\" Tankard nunca ejecuta brew untap --force."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "brew tap-info --installed --json。API モードの公式tapはHomebrewのAPIから読み込まれ、タップされません。信頼はbrew 7のもの（brew trust --tap）です: 「Trust non-official tap formulae, casks or commands so Homebrew may load them.」Tankardはbrew untap --forceを実行しません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "brew tap-info --installed --json。API 模式下的官方 tap 读取自 Homebrew 的 API，并未添加 tap。信任采用 brew 7 的机制 (brew trust --tap)：“Trust non-official tap formulae, casks or commands so Homebrew may load them.” Tankard 从不运行 brew untap --force。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "brew tap-info --installed --json. Os taps oficiais no modo API são lidos da API do Homebrew e não são tapped. A confiança é a do brew 7 (brew trust --tap): \"Trust non-official tap formulae, casks or commands so Homebrew may load them.\" O Tankard nunca executa brew untap --force."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "brew tap-info --installed --json. I tap ufficiali in modalità API vengono letti dall'API di Homebrew e non sono aggiunti come tap. L'attendibilità è quella di brew 7 (brew trust --tap): \"Trust non-official tap formulae, casks or commands so Homebrew may load them.\" Tankard non esegue mai brew untap --force."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "brew tap-info --installed --json. API 모드의 공식 tap은 Homebrew의 API에서 읽으며 탭되지 않습니다. 신뢰는 brew 7의 것입니다(brew trust --tap): \"Trust non-official tap formulae, casks or commands so Homebrew may load them.\" Tankard는 brew untap --force를 실행하지 않습니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "brew tap-info printed something Tankard couldn't read.": {
      "localizations": {
